        "zh": "以钢铁、煤炭行业为重点去产能，全年退出钢铁产能超过6500万吨、煤炭产能超过2.9亿吨，超额完成年度目标任务，分流职工得到较好安置。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haeujcoengh nungzminzgungh daengj youq hawsingz cawx ranz, daezsang aen beijlaeh gaijcauh ranzdiengz yungh cienz anceiq, fangzdicanj gemj daenzcang aeu ndaej cingzyauq ndei.",
