    {
        "zhuang": "Laebndei aen gihci coicaenh lajmbanj cauhnieb cauhmoq, gungganq engq lai cizyez nungzminz moq, haeujcoengh nungzminzgungh dauq ma ranzmbanj cauhnieb, caenh'itbouh yungh banhfap bae gikcoi gauhyau bizyezswngh、bouxbing doiqok doihbing、boux guh gohgi bae lajmbanj yungh dungxcaiz bonjsaeh.",
        "zh": "健全农村“双创”促进机制，培养更多新型职业农民，支持农民工返乡创业，进一步采取措施鼓励高校毕业生、退役军人、科技人员到农村施展才华。",
