    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Daezsang gij beijlwd lajmbanj gwn raemx ancienz、baujcingq gung raemx.",
        "zh": "提高农村饮水安全供水保证率。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyarengz gaijcauh gij ranzvaih lajmbanj.",
        "zh": "加大农村危房改造力度。",
        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Haeujlaeg doicaenh cingjceih gij vanzging vunz youq lajmbanj, hwnqguh gij ranzmbanj gyaeundei gawq miz vwnzmingz ciuhneix、youh miz gingjsaek reihnaz.",
        "zh": "深入推进农村人居环境整治，建设既有现代文明、又具田园风光的美丽乡村。",
