        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Gyadaih aen gvaengh cuzgouj saenqyungh baujyiemj cwgoemq, doiq cuzgouj baenzdauq sezbei yungzswh gij wnggai bauj de couh caenhliengh bauj.",
