        "source": "government_work_report"
    },
    {
        "zhuang": "Demgya cingouj gij gisuz、sezbei senhcin caeuq gij lingzgen bugen youqgaenj de, coicaenh gaicawx doxdaengh fazcanj caeuq canjnieb ndaw guek gyavaiq swnggaep.",
