    {
        "zhuang": "Haeujcoengh gij giyez youz canghseng'eiq guekrog douzswh haenx youq ndaw guek goenghai fathengz gujbyau、fatcaiq, cinjhawj caeuqfaenh guekgya gohgi giva hanghmoeg.",
